### Get all products
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products

### Get product by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/product/1

### Search products
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/search?q=phone

### Create product
POST http://localhost:3000/api/product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "phone",
  "price": 99.99
}

### Update product (PUT - full update)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/product/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Product",
  "price": 150
}

### Update product (PATCH - partial update name)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/product/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Patched Name"
}

### Update product (PATCH - partial update price)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/product/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 200
}

### Delete product
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/product/1
